cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these data, please cite them as below."
title: "Functional diversity of the Las Peñas campus (ESPOL): analysis pipeline and field dataset"
abstract: >-
  R pipeline and field dataset used to characterize the functional diversity
  (FRic, FEve, FDiv, FDis, Rao's Q and functional redundancy) of the flora and
  fauna of the Las Peñas campus (ESPOL, Guayaquil, Ecuador), an urban green area
  adjacent to tropical dry forest remnants, as a pre-intervention reference
  condition for the campus remodeling. Includes Gower distances on mixed traits,
  PCoA with correction for negative eigenvalues, abundance-weighting sensitivity
  analysis, null models for richness-independent effect sizes, taxonomic
  diversity for contrast, and zone-level heatmaps.
